@startuml

actor Client
participant "Service X" as SX
participant "Payment Gateway" as PG

Client -> SX: Charge \$100
SX -> PG: POST /charge
alt PG healthy
  PG --> SX: 200 OK
  SX --> Client: Success
else PG slow/unhealthy
  PG --> SX: Timeout/Error
  activate SX
  SX --> Client: Fallback Response
  deactivate SX
end
@enduml